{"unit_id":"RizenHNT__dsh-skin-digital-arcade#card-zh","repo":"RizenHNT/dsh-skin-digital-arcade","commit":"c14020575d68486edd726176aaffa9a07eac343f","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"Digital Arcade（DSH 插件，Web 客户端）：为 DeepSeek Harness Web GUI 添加可选的像素霓虹街机外观。它通过 Web 插件注入样式并在本地提供字体与图片资源，也在客户端接入主题选择和详情浮窗运行时。主要功能包括像素霓虹主题切换、鲸鱼娘称呼自定义、点击反馈，以及思考内容、工具输出和代码面板的拖动、缩放、停靠与层叠排列。适合希望调整 DSH 网页工作台视觉风格并整理浮动详情窗口的用户。使用需要已运行的 Harness Web GUI；不需要额外密钥或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:78-90"]}
{"unit_id":"RizenHNT__dsh-skin-digital-arcade#card-en","repo":"RizenHNT/dsh-skin-digital-arcade","commit":"c14020575d68486edd726176aaffa9a07eac343f","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"Digital Arcade adds a pixel-neon theme to the DSH Web GUI. Its client offers theme and character-name controls, pointer effects, and movable, resizable detail panels. It suits users who want an arcade-style workspace. Requires Harness Web GUI; no key or external service.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:78-90"]}
