{"unit_id":"RizenHNT__dsh-skin-digital-arcade#feature-theme","repo":"RizenHNT/dsh-skin-digital-arcade","commit":"c14020575d68486edd726176aaffa9a07eac343f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Digital Arcade 的功能「像素霓虹外观」：在 Web GUI 的外观主题选择中加入 arcade 深色主题，并根据当前主题同步页面样式状态。用户可从主题选项启用它，偏好会保存在浏览器本地。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/appearance.ts:5-20"]}
{"unit_id":"RizenHNT__dsh-skin-digital-arcade#feature-name","repo":"RizenHNT/dsh-skin-digital-arcade","commit":"c14020575d68486edd726176aaffa9a07eac343f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Digital Arcade 的功能「角色称呼自定义」：在外观设置中显示鲸鱼娘名字输入框，最多可输入 24 个字符。输入内容保存在当前浏览器的 localStorage，并发出名称变更事件供页面更新显示。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/appearance.ts:38-47"]}
{"unit_id":"RizenHNT__dsh-skin-digital-arcade#feature-panels","repo":"RizenHNT/dsh-skin-digital-arcade","commit":"c14020575d68486edd726176aaffa9a07eac343f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Digital Arcade 的功能「详情面板浮动整理」：思考、工具输出和代码详情面板可在页面中拖动、调整大小并按层级显示；收起的面板可放入侧边停靠区，代码块也能通过横幅交互浮起或还原。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:407-425"]}
{"unit_id":"RizenHNT__dsh-skin-digital-arcade#feature-codefloat","repo":"RizenHNT/dsh-skin-digital-arcade","commit":"c14020575d68486edd726176aaffa9a07eac343f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Digital Arcade 的功能「代码块浮起」：用户拖动代码块横幅可将代码详情从对话流中浮起，并继续拖到视口范围内的位置；再次点击可将其还原到原位置。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:634-683"]}
{"unit_id":"RizenHNT__dsh-skin-digital-arcade#feature-feedback","repo":"RizenHNT/dsh-skin-digital-arcade","commit":"c14020575d68486edd726176aaffa9a07eac343f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Digital Arcade 的功能「街机点击反馈」：启用像素霓虹主题时，点击非输入类控件会在指针位置显示短暂的视觉反馈；文本框、文本区和可编辑区域不会触发该效果。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:117-140"]}
